{% comment %}
  Opts into cross-document (MPA) view transitions. Emitted per-layout because assets/base.css is
  shared and can't read theme settings.

  OM: Horizon also rendered `<link rel="expect" href="#MainContent" blocking="render">` here, which
  holds first paint for up to 1800 ms so the transition runs consistently. Removed: transitions are
  a progressive enhancement and must never delay navigation (DECISIONS.md D-033).
  view-transitions.js already treats the blocker as optional.
{% endcomment %}
{% if settings.transition_to_main_product or settings.page_transition_enabled %}
  {% style %}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      @view-transition {
        navigation: auto;
      }
    }
  {% endstyle %}
{% endif %}
